Builds the country lists used by OPNsense GeoIP aliases from the free
IP to Country database of IPLocate.io (https://www.iplocate.io), licensed
under CC BY-SA 4.0. No account, license key or download URL is required,
and no MaxMind data is used.

The lists are written where OPNsense reads GeoIP data, so existing GeoIP
aliases keep working unchanged. Updates run on demand or on a daily schedule,
and the page shows statistics about the last update and a country lookup.

IP address data powered by IPLocate.io.

